==Volapük==

===Etymology===
From the genitive of {{l|vo|volapük}} ''world language'' + {{l|vo|tidel}} ''teacher'' (> {{l|vo|volapük}} + ''{{l|vo|-a}}'' + {{l|vo|tidel}})

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|vo|[volapykatiˈdel]}}

===Noun===
{{vo-noun}}

# {{lb|vo|obsolete}} A [[teacher]] of a [[world language]] (≠ Volapükatidel), replaced by [[volapükitidan]].

